{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a thrilling vertical adventure in Circle Jump! In this fast-paced arcade game, every screen tap propels your circle upward, challenging you to dodge obstacles and reach new heights in an ever-changing world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Simple, Intuitive Controls:</strong> Just tap the screen to make your circle jump. Easy to pick up but challenging to master!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless Action:</strong> With dynamically generated levels and increasing difficulty, every jump is a new challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stunning Visuals:</strong> Enjoy vibrant colors and smooth animations that transform each leap into a visual spectacle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immersive Soundtrack:</strong> Experience a captivating audio experience that perfectly complements the fast-paced gameplay.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3614480?t=1742951817","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3614480?t=1742951817","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614480/d48c79bd225d117c03e5ca41f6cfc4020a976ea5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742951817","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614480/d48c79bd225d117c03e5ca41f6cfc4020a976ea5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742951817","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a thrilling vertical adventure in Circle Jump! In this fast-paced arcade game, every screen tap propels your circle upward, challenging you to dodge obstacles and reach new heights in an ever-changing world.</p><p class=\"bb_par